etwork requests, and file system access limited to `~/code/memory.md` for user-explicit preferences. The `SKILL.md` explicitly states 'This skill NEVER: Executes code automatically, Makes network requests, Accesses files outside `~/code/` and the user's project'. There is no evidence of intentional harmful behavior, data exfiltration, or prompt injection attempts to bypass these controls.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779163175828},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":9,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1789060877821},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This coding workflow skill is limited to planning and verification guidance, with only disclosed local preference storage when the user asks for it.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill discloses reading the user's project and included reference files, makes no network requests, and does not request broad system access.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The package is Markdown-only with no executable scripts or dependency installation requirements in the inspected artifacts.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Planning guidance includes broad trigger examples such as build/create/implement, but the main skill scopes use to explicit code implementation and excludes simple changes or questions.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"It may create and use ~/code/memory.md for user-stated preferences, but this is disclosed, local, narrow, and gated on explicit user request.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifacts consistently describe a coding workflow helper for planning, implementation steps, verification, and testing; the referenced files match that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you want the agent to follow a structured coding workflow and optionally remember coding preferences in ~/code/memory.md when you explicitly ask it to.","findings":"[SQP-1] expected: The broad wording in planning.md can cause extra workflow guidance to appear, but it is coherent with a coding workflow skill and does not add hidden access, execution, network use, or high-impact authority.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789060877821}}}}}